PTX LB+relaxed.sys+global+same-cluster
"Load buffering in global memory, the threads in two CTAs of one cluster, relaxed at .sys"
{
x=0;
y=0;
P0:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0    | P1@cta 1,cluster 0,gpu 0    ;
 ld.relaxed.sys.global r0, x | ld.relaxed.sys.global r1, y ;
 st.relaxed.sys.global y, 1  | st.relaxed.sys.global x, 1  ;
exists
(P0:r0 == 1 /\ P1:r1 == 1)
